# Astro Patterns

## Components vs pages

- **`.astro` components** for static UI (Header, RecipeCard, StepList, IngredientList)
- **`.tsx` islands** only when client interactivity is needed — use `client:load` sparingly
- Pages live under `src/pages/{locale}/` and use `getStaticPaths()` for dynamic routes

## Component structure

```astro
---
interface Props {
  title: string;
  locale: Locale;
}
const { title, locale } = Astro.props;
---

<section>...</section>
```

- Type props with `interface Props`
- Import `Locale` from `src/lib/recipes.ts` for locale-typed props
- Pass `locale` to `Layout` so `<html lang>` and nav stay consistent

## Styling

- Use Tailwind utility classes; design tokens are `warm-*`, `cream`, `accent`
- Prose content uses `.recipe-prose` for MDX body text
- Do not add global CSS unless extending `@theme` or shared prose styles

## Data fetching

- Fetch content in the frontmatter (--- block), not in the template
- Use helpers from `src/lib/recipes.ts` instead of duplicating collection queries
- Redirect or 404 when content is missing — see recipe `[slug].astro` pages
